K10-K12  TASK 2(ii) -- the two-stream route: Cauchy-Schwarz, not a pressure
====================================================================================================
  two streams +-v along z, each with dispersion sigma:
      T^zz = rho(<v_z^2>) = rho(v^2 + sigma^2) ,  T^xx = T^yy = rho sigma^2
      trace = rho(3 sigma^2 + v^2) ,  w = (3 sigma^2 + v^2)/(3 c^2) >= 0
K10 PASS min w over (v,sigma) = 0.000e+00 >= 0 :: the counter-stream stress is positive for EVERY (v,sigma); the equation 3 sigma^2 + v^2 = -c^2/2 has no real solution. p_ij = rho<dv_i dv_j> is a covariance matrix: PSD by construction. 'Negative longitudinal pressure' would violate Cauchy-Schwarz
K11 PASS v_needed(if p_z=rho(sigma^2-v^2)) = 2.1199e+08 m/s = 0.7071 c; v/sigma_vir = 303; crossing time 1 Mpc = 4.6 kyr v/c = 0.7071, ratio > 100, t < 100 kyr :: even the WRONG formula p_z = rho(sigma^2 - v^2) needs a counter-stream at v = c/sqrt2 = 0.707c (v^2 = 3 sigma^2 + c^2/2 -> c^2/2 at sigma->0): 303x the virial velocity, crossing 1 Mpc in 4.6 kyr and 2992 times in a Hubble time. A 0.7c stream is hot dark matter and free-streams out of a 1e14 Msun halo

  K12  the response: linearised Vlasov-Poisson for two cold beams +-v, density rho/2 each:
       1 = (omega_J^2/2) [ 1/(omega-kv)^2 + 1/(omega+kv)^2 ] ,  omega_J^2 = 4 pi G rho
       k -> 0:  omega^2 = omega_J^2 + k^2 v^2   =>   c_eff^2 = v^2 > 0
       unstable only for k v < omega_J, i.e. lambda > 2 pi v / omega_J
      rho(0.6 Mpc) = 1.840e-24 kg/m^3 -> omega_J = 3.928e-17 /s
      for the v = 0.707c that the erroneous formula needs: unstable only for lambda > 1.099e+03 Mpc (366x the whole stacked annulus)
K12 PASS c_eff^2(k->0) = v^2 > 0; lambda_unstable = 1.10e+03 Mpc for v=0.707c > 100 Mpc :: the 'negative longitudinal pressure' of a counter-stream is at best the sign of the linear RESPONSE, not of T^ij: u = 1+3w is built from T^ij, so the response cannot supply it. And even the response is positive (c_eff^2 = v^2) in the k -> 0 limit an equation of state refers to; its negative branch needs lambda > 1 Gpc for the required v, which is 366x the whole annulus. At cluster scales there is neither a negative stress nor a negative response

